## 5️⃣ Alternative clean FIX (best UVM style)

### Pass argument to automatic task

```systemverilog
task automatic wait_cpl(input int tag);
  wait_for_cpl(tag);
endtask

for (int tag=0; tag<32; tag++) begin
  fork
    wait_cpl(tag);
  join_none
end
```

✔ Arguments are copied
✔ Thread-safe
✔ Clean design

