## 7️⃣ Interview-ready explanation (VERY IMPORTANT)

> **This is a concurrency bug caused by using a shared loop variable inside a `fork…join_none`. All forked threads see the final value of the variable. Capturing the variable or passing it as an argument fixes the issue.**

---

## 8️⃣ One golden rule 🧠

> **Never use loop variables directly inside forked threads. Always capture or pass them.**

